</section>
<section class="review-section" id="faq">
<h2><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path><line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="17" y2="17"></line></svg> Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question">Is Arko AI suitable for large commercial projects?</div><div class="faq-answer">Arko AI is primarily optimized for residential and small commercial projects. For large-scale commercial or institutional buildings, you may need more specialized tools like Hypar or traditional BIM workflows.</div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question">Can I edit the AI-generated floor plans?</div><div class="faq-answer">Yes, Arko AI provides parametric controls that allow you to adjust room sizes, wall positions, and other elements. You can also export to BIM software for detailed refinement.</div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question">Does Arko AI replace traditional architectural software?</div><div class="faq-answer">No, Arko AI is designed to accelerate the early design phase, not replace comprehensive BIM platforms. Most architects use it for concept generation, then refine designs in Revit or ArchiCAD.</div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question">How accurate is the code compliance checking?</div><div class="faq-answer">Arko AI's code compliance features are improving but should be verified by a licensed professional. It's excellent for catching obvious issues early, but cannot replace proper code review.</div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question">What file formats can I export to?</div><div class="faq-answer">Professional and Enterprise plans support DWG, DXF, IFC, Revit (RVT), and PDF exports. The free tier is limited to PDF with watermarks.</div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question">Is there a learning curve?</div><div class="faq-answer">The basic interface is quite intuitive, and most architects can generate their first design within 15 minutes. Mastering the parametric controls and optimization features takes a few hours of practice.</div></div>
</section>
